@* Shared "nothing here" body. Used by App.razor's <NotFound> (an unmatched
   route) and, inline, by any page whose "/{Locale}/slug" route parameter
   turned out not to be one of the six supported locale codes -- Blazor's
   router can't retroactively fall through to <NotFound> once a templated
   route has already matched, so those pages render this explicitly instead
   (see LocalizationService.ResolveRouteLocale). *@
<PageTitle>Not found</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
</HeadContent>
<p role="alert">Sorry, there's nothing at this address.</p>
